          "id": "home-section-3",
          "nl_prompt": "Design an asymmetric bento feature grid section on the Clearmind Cloud (#F5F7FA) background with 100px vertical padding. At the top of the section, left-aligned within the 1200px container, render the eyebrow label 'Why Clearmind' in DM Sans 500, 11px uppercase, 0.10em letter-spacing, Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C). Below it, render the headline 'Therapy that fits your life \u2014 not the other way around.' in Manrope 800, 44px, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332), letter-spacing -0.02em, left-aligned, max-width 600px. Below the headline, render the subheadline 'We built our practice around you: your schedule, your pace, your goals.' in Source Sans 3 400, 17px, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F), left-aligned, max-width 520px, line-height 1.7. Below the text header block (32px gap), render the four feature items in an asymmetric bento grid layout: on desktop, use a 2-column layout where the left column is wider (roughly 58%) containing two stacked tiles, and the right column (42%) contains one tall tile and one shorter tile, all with 16px gaps. Each feature tile is a rounded rectangle (16px radius) with 32px internal padding. Tile 1 ('Evidence-Based Methods') uses Clearmind White background, is standard height (~180px), has a small Sage-colored icon placeholder (24px square, top-left of content), the title in Manrope 700 18px Slate, and description in Source Sans 3 400 15px Stone. Tile 2 ('In-Person & Telehealth') uses Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8) background, same sizing and treatment. Tile 3 ('Diverse Specialties') spans the full height of the right column (tall tile, ~376px), uses Clearmind Slate (#1A2332) as its background, with the title in Manrope 700 20px Clearmind White, description in Source Sans 3 400 15px rgba(255,255,255,0.75), and a large decorative Sage-tinted abstract shape (soft circle or arc) as a background element at low opacity (0.12) to add depth. Tile 4 ('No Waitlist Pressure') uses Clearmind Mist background, standard height, same text treatment as Tiles 1\u20132. All tiles have box-shadow (0 2px 16px rgba(26,35,50,0.06)). Below the grid, left-align the CTA 'See All Services' as a text link with a Sage underline and right-pointing arrow in Manrope 600 15px Sage, with a hover state that shifts to Slate. On tablet, collapse to a 2-column equal grid. On mobile, stack all four tiles to single column full-width."
