esser. Same left-border accent in Sage. Same metadata structure: 'Availability' / 'Mon\u2013Sun', 'Location' / 'Anywhere with a secure connection'.\n\nNo CTAs in this section. The section ends with 72px bottom padding before transitioning to the FAQ section. On desktop, both panels are equal in height (CSS grid stretch), so they always align vertically regardless of content length."
