2px below the last item: A text-link CTA \u2014 'Still have questions? Contact us' \u2014 in DM Sans 500, 15px, Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C), underlined on hover, with a small right-arrow glyph inline. This is a low-commitment secondary action, not a button."
