lly on tablet. On mobile, the illustration is hidden (display:none) to keep the CTA focused and uncluttered. The illustration uses the Clearmind palette \u2014 Sage, Mist, and Dew shapes \u2014 so it integrates seamlessly with the Dew background without appearing as a foreign element. No drop shadow on the illustration; it sits flat against the Dew background.\n\nThe section has no top or bottom border \u2014 it transitions from the FAQ's White background to Dew naturally, and the page ends after this section (before the site footer). The footer sits directly below on the same Cloud background as the rest of the site."
