ge is fully responsive: the bento grid collapses from a 3-column or asymmetric layout on desktop to a 2-column layout on tablet and a single-column stacked layout on mobile. All card modules maintain their rounded corners, internal padding (24\u201332px), and typographic hierarchy across breakpoints.\n\nThe navigation bar (inherited from the shared design system) sits at the top in Clearmind Slate with the Clearmind Therapy wordmark on the left, navigation links in Stone with Sage active state, and a Sage-filled \"Book a Session\" CTA button on the right. The Practitioners link in the nav is in the active/highlighted state on this page. The page ends with a footer in Clearmind Slate with white and Stone text, consistent with the rest of the site.",
