pped at 3 lines with a subtle fade if truncated on smaller cards.\n\nBelow the description, a thin 1px Clearmind Mist (#E8EEF4) divider. Below the divider, 12px gap, render three metadata tags in a horizontal flex row (wrapping on small cards): 'Format' and 'Accepting' values each as a small pill tag \u2014 Clearmind Mist background, Clearmind Stone text, DM Sans 500, 10px uppercase, 0.08em tracking, 6px vertical / 10px horizontal padding, 6px border radius. If 'New clients welcome', the accepting pill uses Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8) background with Clearmind Sage text. If 'Limited availability', the pill uses a light Coral tint (#FAE8E5) background with Clearmind Coral (#E8715A) text.\n\nBelow the card grid, 48px gap, center a single CTA button: 'Book with a Practitioner' \u2014 Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) fill, white Manrope 700 text, 16px, 14px vertical / 32px horizontal padding, 10px border radius. On hover, the button darkens to a deeper sage tone."
