      "page_level_design_instruction": "The Resources page functions as Clearmind Therapy's editorial hub \u2014 a calm, authoritative, and genuinely useful destination that feels more like a trusted clinical library than a marketing page. The overall tone is warm-intellectual: organized and modern through the bento-modular aesthetic, yet human and approachable through the brand voice.\n\n**Page Color Strategy:** The page background is Clearmind Cloud (#F5F7FA) throughout, providing a clean, airy reading environment. Bento card surfaces alternate between Clearmind White (#FFFFFF) and Clearmind Mist (#E8EEF4) to create visual rhythm without noise. Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8) is used as a soft tint on feature category tiles and the story block panel. Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) appears on category tags, read-time badges, interactive hover states, CTA buttons, and key accent elements. Clearmind Slate (#1A2332) anchors all primary headings and navigation. Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F) handles all secondary text, metadata, captions, and supporting copy. Clearmind Coral (#E8715A) is used sparingly \u2014 only on the crisis support resource tile \u2014 to signal urgency and warmth appropriately.\n\n**Typography Rhythm:** All section eyebrows use DM Sans medium (500), uppercase, wide letter-spacing (0.10em), in Clearmind Stone. Section headlines use Manrope extrabold (800), tight letter-spacing (-0.025em), in Clearmind Slate. Subheadlines use Manrope regular-to-semibold (400\u2013600) in Clearmind Stone. Article titles within cards use Manrope bold (700) in Clearmind Slate. Body copy and article descriptions use Source Sans 3 regular (400), line-height 1.70, in Clearmind Stone or Slate depending on surface.\n\n**Layout Family \u2014 Classic Landing:** The page stacks vertically in this order: page header \u2192 featured article list \u2192 resource library grid \u2192 clinical team story block \u2192 closing CTA. Sections are separated by generous vertical spacing (80\u2013100px on desktop, 56\u201364px on mobile) to allow the editorial content to breathe. No horizontal rules or hard dividers \u2014 section rhythm is managed through background color shifts and spacing alone.\n\n**Bento Modular Aesthetic:** The article list section uses an asymmetric bento card grid (not a uniform table), with cards of varying visual weight \u2014 a hero-sized featured card at top-left and smaller supporting cards filling the remaining grid. The resource library section uses a 2\u00d72 bento grid of rounded feature tiles with icons. The story block uses a single wide editorial panel. This creates a dashboard-like rhythm without feeling cold or corporate.\n\n**Density:** Medium-high editorial density in the article list, balanced by generous padding within each card. The feature grid and story block sections are lower density \u2014 more breathing room, larger type, more whitespace. The CTA section is the lightest of all \u2014 minimal, focused, conversion-oriented.\n\n**Responsive Behavior:** On desktop (1280px+), the article list bento grid is a 3-column layout with a spanning hero card. On tablet (768\u20131279px), it collapses to a 2-column grid. On mobile (<768px), all grids become single-column stacks. The resource library grid is 2\u00d72 on desktop/tablet, single-column on mobile. Navigation remains fixed at top. All card padding scales down proportionally on smaller viewports.\n\n**Cross-Page Fit:** The Resources page shares the same top navigation and footer as all other pages. It is the most content-dense page in the site, sitting between the Practitioners detail page and the Contact page. It should feel like a natural editorial pause before the final conversion push on Contact \u2014 educational, generous, trust-building. The closing CTA section bridges directly to the Contact page's booking flow.",
      "section_design_plans": [
        {
          "id": "resources-section-1",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a page header section for the Resources page that immediately signals editorial value and calm authority \u2014 this is not a hero with a big sales pitch, but a welcoming entry point into a knowledge library.\n\n**Layout:** Centered single-column layout, constrained to approximately 720px max-width, vertically padded at 96px top and 72px bottom on desktop. The section sits directly below the fixed navigation bar on a Clearmind Cloud (#F5F7FA) background \u2014 no background panel change, just open canvas.\n\n**Eyebrow:** 'Mental Health Resources' rendered in DM Sans medium (500), uppercase, letter-spacing 0.10em, Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) color. Positioned above the headline with 12px margin below.\n\n**Headline:** 'Knowledge that supports your journey.' in Manrope extrabold (800), approximately 52px on desktop (40px on tablet, 32px on mobile), tight letter-spacing (-0.025em), Clearmind Slate (#1A2332). The word 'journey' may be optionally rendered with a subtle Sage underline accent to draw the eye \u2014 a single 3px underline in Sage beneath that word only, reinforcing the brand accent without being loud.\n\n**Subheadline:** 'Whether you're in therapy, considering it, or supporting someone you love \u2014 these resources are here for you.' rendered in Source Sans 3 regular (400), approximately 20px, line-height 1.70, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F), centered, max-width 600px, with 20px top margin from headline.\n\n**No CTAs, no assets, no cards.** The section ends cleanly and transitions into the article list below. The simplicity here is intentional \u2014 it signals that the content itself is the value, not the marketing wrapper. Horizontal centering of all three text elements. No background shape, illustration, or decorative element."
        },
        {
          "id": "resources-section-2",
          "nl_prompt": "Design an asymmetric bento-modular article list section that serves as the primary editorial discovery mechanism for the Resources page. This section must feel like a curated editorial dashboard \u2014 scannable, organized, and genuinely inviting to read.\n\n**Section Header:** Left-aligned above the grid. Eyebrow 'Featured Articles' in DM Sans medium (500), uppercase, letter-spacing 0.10em, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F). Headline 'Start here.' in Manrope extrabold (800), approximately 38px, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332), tight letter-spacing. Subheadline 'Our most-read guides, written by our clinical team.' in Source Sans 3 regular (400), 17px, Clearmind Stone, below headline with 8px gap. Section top padding 80px, bottom padding 80px.\n\n**Bento Grid Architecture (Desktop \u2014 3 columns, 3 rows):**\n- Row 1: A large hero article card spans columns 1\u20132 (two-thirds width), tall aspect ratio. The third column holds a standard article card (one-third width, full row height).\n- Row 2: Three equal-width standard article cards across all three columns.\n- Total: 6 article cards displayed. Grid gap of 16px between all cells.\n\n**Hero Card (Article 1 \u2014 'What to Expect in Your First Therapy Session'):** Background Clearmind White (#FFFFFF), 20px border-radius, 32px internal padding. A thin top-edge color bar in Clearmind Sage (#4AAE8C) \u2014 4px tall, full card width, flush at top, rounded at top corners. Category tag 'Getting Started' in DM Sans medium (500), uppercase, 11px, letter-spacing 0.10em, Clearmind Sage, displayed as a small pill badge with Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8) background. Article title in Manrope bold (700), approximately 26px, Clearmind Slate, with 12px top margin from badge. Description in Source Sans 3 regular (400), 15px, line-height 1.65, Clearmind Stone, max 3 lines. Read-time '5 min read' in DM Sans medium (500), 12px, Clearmind Stone, with a small clock icon in Sage, positioned at card bottom. Card has a subtle box-shadow (0 2px 12px rgba(26,35,50,0.07)) and a hover state that lifts shadow and shifts the top color bar to full Sage saturation.\n\n**Standard Article Cards (Articles 2\u20136):** Background Clearmind White (#FFFFFF), 20px border-radius, 24px internal padding. Same category pill badge system (each category gets Clearmind Dew background with Sage text). Article title in Manrope bold (700), approximately 17px, Clearmind Slate. Description in Source Sans 3 regular (400), 14px, Clearmind Stone, max 2 lines with ellipsis. Read-time metadata at card bottom. Hover state: subtle background shift to Clearmind Mist (#E8EEF4) and a light Sage left-border accent (3px solid Sage on left edge of card).\n\n**Category Color Coding:** Each category tag uses the same Dew/Sage combination for visual consistency \u2014 no per-category color variation. This keeps the grid calm and unified.\n\n**Tablet (2 columns):** Hero card spans full width in row 1. Remaining 5 cards fill 2-column rows below. **Mobile (1 column):** All cards stack vertically, hero card loses its spanning treatment and becomes a standard tall card. Card padding reduces to 20px."
        },
        {
          "id": "resources-section-3",
          "nl_prompt": "Design a feature grid section presenting four distinct resource category tiles in a bento-modular 2\u00d72 layout. This section helps visitors with different needs navigate to the right type of resource \u2014 self-assessment, guides, crisis support, or mindfulness.\n\n**Section Header:** Left-aligned. Eyebrow 'Resource Library' in DM Sans medium (500), uppercase, letter-spacing 0.10em, Clearmind Stone (#6B7A8F). Headline 'Something for every stage of the journey.' in Manrope extrabold (800), approximately 36px, Clearmind Slate (#1A2332). No subheadline. Section background remains Clearmind Cloud (#F5F7FA). Top padding 80px, bottom padding 80px.\n\n**Grid Layout:** 2 columns \u00d7 2 rows on desktop and tablet, single column on mobile. Grid gap 16px. Each tile is a rounded bento module with 28px border-radius and 32px internal padding.\n\n**Tile Styling:**\n- Tiles 1, 2, 4 (Self-Assessment, Therapist Guides, Mindfulness): Background Clearmind Dew (#D6F0E8), giving a soft sage-tinted warmth.\n- Tile 3 (Crisis & Support Lines): Background Clearmind White (#FFFFFF) with a subtle Clearmind Coral (#E8715A) accent \u2014 specifically a 3px left-border in Coral and the icon rendered in Coral \u2014 to signal urgency and care without alarming the user. This is the only place Coral appears in this section.\n\n**Icon Placement (from asset idea \u2014 four minimal line icons):**\n- Each tile displays its icon in the top-left corner of the tile, rendered at 40\u00d740px.\n- Checklist icon (Self-Assessment): Clearmind Sage stroke.\n- Open book icon (Therapist Guides): Clearmind Sage stroke.\n- Phone lifeline icon (Crisis Support): Clearmind Coral stroke (matching the tile's accent treatment).\n- Leaf icon (Mindfulness): Clearmind Sage stroke.\n- Icons use a consistent 1.5px stroke weight, minimal and geometric, no fills.\n\n**Tile Content Structure (top to bottom within each tile):**\n1. Icon (40\u00d740px, top-left).\n2. Tile title in Manrope bold (700), 20px, Clearmind Slate, 16px below icon.\n3. Description in Source Sans 3 regular (400), 15px, line-height 1.65, Clearmind Stone, 8px below title.\n4. A subtle 'Explore \u2192' link in DM Sans medium (500), 13px, Clearmind Sage, at the bottom of the tile \u2014 no button, just a text link with an arrow, appearing on hover with a Sage underline.\n\n**Tile Sizing:** On desktop, each tile is equal size \u2014 approximately 50% column width minus half the gap. Tiles are tall enough to comfortably hold all content with generous padding, approximately 240\u2013280px tall. No tile is larger than another \u2014 this is a symmetric 2\u00d72 grid, unlike the asymmetric article grid above, which provides visual variety across sections.\n\n**Hover State:** Tiles 1, 2, 4 shift background from Dew to a slightly deeper Mist (#E8EEF4) on hover. Tile 3 adds a very subtle Coral background tint (#FDF2F0) on hover. All tiles get a lift shadow on hover (0 4px 16px rgba(26,35,50,0.10))."
        },

input.content:
/* ==============================================================
   Clearmind Therapy — Reference Site
   Typography: Manrope (heading), Source Sans 3 (body), DM Sans (accent)
   ============================================================== */

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --slate: #1A2332;
  --cloud: #F5F7FA;
  --sage: #4AAE8C;
  --sage-deep: #3A9478;
  --mist: #E8EEF4;
  --stone: #6B7A8F;
  --dew: #D6F0E8;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --coral: #E8715A;
  --coral-tint: #FAE8E5;
  --coral-bg: #FDF2F0;

  --shadow-soft: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  --shadow-soft-lg: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  --shadow-hover: 0 6px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);

  --radius-sm: 8px;
  --radius-md: 12px;
  --radius-lg: 16px;
  --radius-xl: 20px;
  --radius-2xl: 24px;

  --container: 1200px;
  --container-narrow: 1120px;

  --font-heading: 'Manrope', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-accent: 'DM Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  background: var(--cloud);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

img,
svg {
  max-width: 100%;
  display: block;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

p {
  margin: 0 0 1em;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

button {
  font-family: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* ============= Layout primitives ============= */
.container {
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

.container--narrow {
  max-width: var(--container-narrow);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

/* ============= Eyebrow / Accent text ============= */
.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  display: inline-block;
}

.eyebrow--sage {
  color: var(--sage);
}

/* ============= Buttons ============= */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  background: transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.btn--primary {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.btn--primary:hover {
  background: var(--sage-deep);
  border-color: var(--sage-deep);
}

.btn--secondary {
  color: var(--slate);
  border-color: var(--slate);
}
.btn--secondary:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.btn--ghost-light {
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--white);
}
.btn--ghost-light:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
}

.btn--outline-stone {
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--slate);
  border-color: var(--stone);
}
.btn--outline-stone:hover {
  border-color: var(--sage);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.btn--small {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.text-link {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--sage);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
  transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}
.text-link:hover {
  color: var(--slate);
  border-bottom-color: var(--slate);
}

.text-link__arrow {
  display: inline-block;
  transition: transform 200ms ease;
}
.text-link:hover .text-link__arrow {
  transform: translateX(3px);
}

/* ============= Site Navigation ============= */
.site-nav {
  background: var(--slate);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

.site-nav__inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 18px 24px;
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  gap: 24px;
}

.site-nav__brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 18px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.brand-mark {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.site-nav__links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
  align-items: center;
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

.site-nav__link {
  color: #B8C3D0;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 14px;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  transition: color 200ms ease, background 200ms ease;
}
.site-nav__link:hover {
  color: var(--white);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
}
.site-nav__link.is-active {
  color: var(--sage);
}

.site-nav__cta {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: background 200ms ease;
}
.site-nav__cta:hover {
  background: var(--sage-deep);
}

.nav-toggle {
  display: none;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 8px;
  color: var(--white);
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .site-nav__links {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: var(--slate);
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 16px;
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }
  .site-nav__links.is-open {
    display: flex;
  }
  .site-nav__link {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .site-nav__cta {
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .nav-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .site-nav {
    position: relative;
  }
}

/* ============= Footer ============= */
.site-footer {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: #B8C3D0;
  padding: 64px 0 32px;
}

.site-footer__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  padding-bottom: 40px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
}

.site-footer__col h4 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.site-footer__col ul {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

.site-footer__col li {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.site-footer__col a {
  color: #B8C3D0;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: color 200ms ease;
}
.site-footer__col a:hover {
  color: var(--sage);
}

.site-footer__brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.site-footer__tagline {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #B8C3D0;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 320px;
}

.site-footer__bottom {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding-top: 24px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #8895A8;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .site-footer__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .site-footer__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }
}

/* ============= Section base ============= */
section {
  padding: 100px 0;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  section { padding: 72px 0; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  section { padding: 56px 0; }
}

.section--mist { background: var(--mist); }
.section--white { background: var(--white); }
.section--cloud { background: var(--cloud); }
.section--slate { background: var(--slate); color: var(--white); }
.section--dew { background: var(--dew); }
.section--gradient {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--dew) 0%, var(--cloud) 100%);
}

.section-head {
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.section-head--center {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.section-head h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.section-head p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 580px;
}

.section-head--center p {
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
}

/* ============= HOME — Hero ============= */
.hero {
  padding: 96px 0 100px;
  background: var(--cloud);
}

.hero__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}

.hero__eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.hero__eyebrow::before {
  content: "";
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.hero__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(36px, 5.6vw, 60px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.08;
  margin: 22px 0 24px;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.hero__sub {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--stone);
  max-width: 520px;
  margin: 0 0 32px;
}

.hero__ctas {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 14px;
}

.hero__art {
  border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
  background: var(--white);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  padding: 24px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero__art svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .hero__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .hero__art { max-height: 400px; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .hero__art {
    max-height: 220px;
    padding: 12px;
  }
}

/* ============= Stats ============= */
.stats-head {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.stats-head h2 {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);
  font-weight: 700;
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 12px auto 0;
}

.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.stat-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  min-height: 140px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.stat-card--accent {
  background: var(--dew);
}

.stat-card__value {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 40px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--sage);
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.stat-card--solid .stat-card__value {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-size: 44px;
}

.stat-card__label {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin: 12px 0 0;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Feature grid (asymmetric bento) ============= */
.feature-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: auto auto;
  gap: 16px;
}

.feature-tile {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.feature-tile__icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.feature-tile h3 {
  font-size: 19px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.feature-tile p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0;
}

.feature-tile--dew { background: var(--dew); }
.feature-tile--mist { background: var(--mist); }

.feature-tile--dark {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--white);
  grid-row: 1 / span 2;
  grid-column: 2;
  min-height: 376px;
}

.feature-tile--dark h3 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: 22px;
}

.feature-tile--dark p {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
  font-size: 15px;
}

.feature-tile--dark .feature-tile__icon { color: var(--sage); }

.feature-tile--dark::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 280px;
  height: 280px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.12;
  right: -90px;
  bottom: -90px;
}

.feature-tile--dark::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 180px;
  height: 180px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid rgba(74, 174, 140, 0.18);
  right: 30px;
  top: 30px;
}

.feature-grid__cta {
  margin-top: 28px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .feature-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto;
  }
  .feature-tile--dark {
    grid-row: auto;
    grid-column: auto;
    min-height: 0;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Testimonials ============= */
.testimonial-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.testimonial-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 36px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.testimonial-card--dew {
  background: var(--dew);
}

.testimonial-card__coral-dot {
  position: absolute;
  top: 18px;
  right: 18px;
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--coral);
}

.testimonial-card__quote-mark {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 64px;
  color: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.30;
  line-height: 0.7;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.testimonial-card__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.testimonial-card__body {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.testimonial-card__attr {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: auto;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .testimonial-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .testimonial-card:nth-child(3) { grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 60%; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .testimonial-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .testimonial-card:nth-child(3) { max-width: none; }
}

/* ============= Final CTA Slate ============= */
.final-cta {
  position: relative;
  text-align: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.final-cta__inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.final-cta .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }

.final-cta h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 48px);
  color: var(--white);
  max-width: 640px;
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.final-cta p {
  font-size: 18px;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  max-width: 480px;
  margin: 0 auto 36px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.final-cta__ctas {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.final-cta__pattern {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: 0.5;
  pointer-events: none;
}

@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .final-cta__ctas {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
}

/* ============= Page header (compact) ============= */
.page-header {
  padding: 72px 0 56px;
  text-align: center;
}

.page-header h1 {
  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.page-header p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 19px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 20px auto 0;
}

.page-header__rule {
  width: 48px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--mist);
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
  display: block;
}

.page-header--mist {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.page-header--with-art {
  position: relative;
  text-align: left;
}

.page-header--with-art .container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  align-items: center;
}

.page-header--with-art h1 {
  margin: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.page-header--with-art p {
  margin: 16px 0 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.page-header__cluster {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  align-items: center;
  height: 200px;
  position: relative;
}

.page-header__cluster span {
  display: block;
  width: 80px;
  height: 48px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.page-header__cluster span:nth-child(1) {
  background: var(--dew);
  transform: rotate(-4deg);
}
.page-header__cluster span:nth-child(2) {
  background: var(--white);
  transform: rotate(3deg);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
}
.page-header__cluster span:nth-child(3) {
  background: var(--dew);
  transform: rotate(5deg);
  width: 60px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .page-header--with-art .container {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .page-header--with-art h1,
  .page-header--with-art p { text-align: center; }
  .page-header__cluster { display: none; }
}

/* ============= Services: Item grid ============= */
.service-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.service-card {
  background: var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.service-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}

.service-card__icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.service-card h3 {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 10px;
}

.service-card p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.service-card__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: auto;
}

.pill {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 5px 11px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.pill--mist {
  background: var(--mist);
  color: var(--stone);
}

.pill--coral {
  background: var(--coral-tint);
  color: var(--coral);
}

.service-cta-row {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Comparison ============= */
.compare-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.compare-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.compare-card--dew { background: var(--dew); }

.compare-card h3 {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.compare-card p {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 20px;
}

.compare-card__meta {
  margin-top: auto;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  padding-top: 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
}

.compare-card__meta dt {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.compare-card__meta dd {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= FAQ ============= */
.faq-list {
  max-width: 760px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}

.faq-item {
  background: var(--cloud);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: background 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}

.faq-item.is-open {
  background: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}

.faq-item__btn {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--slate);
  text-align: left;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.faq-item__chevron {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: transform 200ms ease;
  margin-left: 16px;
}

.faq-item.is-open .faq-item__chevron {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.faq-item__panel {
  display: none;
  padding: 0 24px 20px;
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.faq-item.is-open .faq-item__panel {
  display: block;
}

.faq-section__cta {
  margin-top: 32px;
}

/* ============= Services CTA section ============= */
.services-final {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  align-items: center;
}

.services-final__copy h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  max-width: 480px;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.services-final__copy p {
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 420px;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
}

.services-final__ctas {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.services-final__art {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
}

.services-final__art svg {
  max-width: 340px;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .services-final { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .services-final__art { display: none; }
}

/* ============= Practitioners grid ============= */
.practitioner-section .section-head {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.practitioner-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.practitioner-grid__item--wide {
  grid-column: span 2;
}

.practitioner-grid__item--center {
  grid-column: 2;
}

.practitioner-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100%;
}

.practitioner-card__head {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.practitioner-card__avatar {
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: var(--dew);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.practitioner-card__avatar svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.practitioner-card__name {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0 0 6px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.practitioner-card__specialty {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin: 0;
}

.practitioner-card p {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin: 0 0 16px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.practitioner-card__divider {
  border: none;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.practitioner-card__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
}

.tag {
  background: var(--mist);
  color: var(--stone);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 6px;
}

.tag--accept {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.tag--limited {
  background: var(--coral-tint);
  color: var(--coral);
}

.practitioner-cta {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 48px;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .practitioner-grid__item--wide { grid-column: span 2; }
  .practitioner-grid__item--center { grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .practitioner-grid__item--wide,
  .practitioner-grid__item--center { grid-column: auto; max-width: none; }
}

/* ============= Story block (philosophy) ============= */
.story-split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}

.story-split .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }

.story-split h2 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 38px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.story-split p {
  color: #B8C3D0;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 580px;
}

.story-art {
  position: relative;
  height: 340px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.story-art__bg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(232, 238, 244, 0.10);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 40px;
}

.story-art__quote {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: 20px;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.4;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.story-art__tile-tr {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  background: var(--dew);
  opacity: 0.20;
  border-radius: 16px;
}

.story-art__tile-bl {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  background: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.20;
  border-radius: 16px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .story-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .story-art { display: none; }
}

/* ============= Stats with chart ============= */
.stats-with-chart {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.stats-with-chart__cluster {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.stat-card--solid {
  background: var(--white);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 32px;
}

.chart-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.chart-card svg {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 220px;
  height: auto;
}

.chart-card__title {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 16px;
  text-align: center;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .stats-with-chart { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .chart-card { max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .stats-with-chart__cluster { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .stat-card--solid { padding: 22px; }
  .stat-card--solid .stat-card__value { font-size: 32px; }
}

/* ============= CTA reassure note ============= */
.cta-reassure {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 28px;
  text-align: center;
}

.cta-reassure span + span::before {
  content: "·";
  margin: 0 8px;
  color: var(--stone);
}

/* ============= Resources ============= */
.resources-page-header h1 .accent {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
}
.resources-page-header h1 .accent::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 4px;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 2px;
  opacity: 0.85;
}

/* Asymmetric article bento */
.article-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  grid-template-rows: auto auto;
  gap: 16px;
}

.article-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
  border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.article-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);
  background: var(--mist);
  border-left-color: var(--sage);
}

.article-card--hero {
  grid-column: span 2;
  grid-row: span 1;
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: none;
  background: var(--white);
}

.article-card--hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl) var(--radius-xl) 0 0;
}

.article-card--side {
  grid-column: 3;
  grid-row: span 1;
}

.article-card__category {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  padding: 5px 11px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-self: flex-start;
}

.article-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 14px 0 8px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.article-card--hero h3 {
  font-size: 26px;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.article-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.article-card--hero p {
  font-size: 16px;
}

.article-card__time {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: auto;
}

.article-card__time svg {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: span 2; }
  .article-card--side { grid-column: auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: auto; }
}

/* Resource library tiles */
.resource-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.resource-tile {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: 28px;
  padding: 32px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 240px;
  transition: background 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
}

.resource-tile:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.10);
}

.resource-tile--coral {
  background: var(--white);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
}

.resource-tile--coral:hover {
  background: var(--coral-bg);
}

.resource-tile__icon {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.resource-tile--coral .resource-tile__icon { color: var(--coral); }

.resource-tile h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 16px 0 8px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.resource-tile p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.resource-tile__link {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--sage);
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: 4px;
  align-items: center;
  align-self: flex-start;
}

.resource-tile__link:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--sage); }

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .resource-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* Story block (resources) */
.story-block {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.story-block__body {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
  padding-left: 20px;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.story-block h2 {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 40px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
}

/* Resources final CTA (slate split) */
.cta-split-dark {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}

.cta-split-dark .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }

.cta-split-dark h2 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.cta-split-dark p {
  color: #A8B4C2;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  max-width: 520px;
}

.cta-split-dark__ctas {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.cta-split-dark__art {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}

.cta-split-dark__art svg {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 320px;
  height: auto;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .cta-split-dark {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-split-dark__ctas { justify-content: center; }
  .cta-split-dark p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .cta-split-dark__art { order: -1; }
  .cta-split-dark__art svg { max-width: 220px; }
}

/* ============= Contact form ============= */
.contact-block {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.contact-form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.contact-form__head .eyebrow { color: var(--stone); }

.contact-form h2 {
  font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 30px);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 8px 0 12px;
}

.contact-form > p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  max-width: 540px;
}

.contact-form__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
}

.contact-form .field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
}

.contact-form .field--full {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.contact-form label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

.contact-form label .req {
  color: var(--sage);
  font-size: 8px;
}

.contact-form input,
.contact-form select,
.contact-form textarea {
  width: 100%;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background: var(--white);
  transition: border-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.contact-form input::placeholder,
.contact-form textarea::placeholder {
  color: rgba(107, 122, 143, 0.6);
}

.contact-form input:focus,
.contact-form select:focus,
.contact-form textarea:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--sage);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(74, 174, 140, 0.15);
}

.contact-form textarea {
  min-height: 120px;
  resize: vertical;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.contact-form .btn {
  margin-top: 24px;
  width: 100%;
  height: 52px;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.contact-aside {
  position: sticky;
  top: 100px;
}

.reassure-card {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
}

.reassure-card__intro {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.reassure-card__intro svg {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.reassure-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}

.reassure-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.5;
  padding: 5px 0;
}

.reassure-list svg {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.contact-aside__phone {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.contact-aside__phone strong {
  color: var(--sage);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .contact-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  .contact-aside { position: static; }
  .contact-form__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Map block ============= */
.map-block {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.map-tile {
  border-radius: 20px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  background: var(--mist);
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  display: flex;
}

.map-tile svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
}

.map-info h2 {
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 8px 0 12px;
}

.map-info > p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.map-info__address {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.map-info__address strong {
  font-weight: 600;
}

.map-info__list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 24px;
}

.map-info__list-item {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
}

.map-info__list-item svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .map-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Contact info grid (4 cards) ============= */
.contact-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.contact-tile {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 28px 24px;
  transition: background 200ms ease;
}

.contact-tile:hover {
  background: #C5E8DD;
}

.contact-tile__icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.contact-tile h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 16px;
  margin: 12px 0 8px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.contact-tile p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0;
}

.contact-tile p strong {
  color: var(--sage);
  font-weight: 600;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .contact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Contact FAQ ============= */
.contact-faq-block {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.contact-faq-block__aside .eyebrow { color: var(--stone); }

.contact-faq-block__aside h2 {
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 8px 0 28px;
}

.faq-illustration-frame {
  background: var(--mist);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 24px;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.faq-illustration-frame svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  max-height: 240px;
}

.contact-faq-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}

.contact-faq-item {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  transition: background 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.contact-faq-item.is-open {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}

.contact-faq-item__btn {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  padding: 18px 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--slate);
  text-align: left;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.contact-faq-item__plus {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-size: 22px;
  color: var(--sage);
  font-weight: 400;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  line-height: 1;
  transition: transform 200ms ease;
}

.contact-faq-item.is-open .contact-faq-item__plus {
  transform: rotate(45deg);
}

.contact-faq-item__panel {
  display: none;
  padding: 0 24px 18px;
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.contact-faq-item.is-open .contact-faq-item__panel {
  display: block;
}

.contact-faq__safety-net {
  text-align: center;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 40px;
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}
.contact-faq__safety-net strong {
  color: var(--sage);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .contact-faq-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .contact-faq-block__aside { order: -1; }
}

/* ============= Generic SVG color util ============= */
[stroke="currentColor"] { stroke: currentColor; }
[fill="currentColor"] { fill: currentColor; }

/* Print friendly */
@media print {
  .site-nav, .site-footer { display: none; }
}

tool_use_result.content:
/* ==============================================================
   Clearmind Therapy — Reference Site
   Typography: Manrope (heading), Source Sans 3 (body), DM Sans (accent)
   ============================================================== */

@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Source+Sans+3:wght@400;600&family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');

:root {
  --slate: #1A2332;
  --cloud: #F5F7FA;
  --sage: #4AAE8C;
  --sage-deep: #3A9478;
  --mist: #E8EEF4;
  --stone: #6B7A8F;
  --dew: #D6F0E8;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --coral: #E8715A;
  --coral-tint: #FAE8E5;
  --coral-bg: #FDF2F0;

  --shadow-soft: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  --shadow-soft-lg: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  --shadow-hover: 0 6px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);

  --radius-sm: 8px;
  --radius-md: 12px;
  --radius-lg: 16px;
  --radius-xl: 20px;
  --radius-2xl: 24px;

  --container: 1200px;
  --container-narrow: 1120px;

  --font-heading: 'Manrope', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-body: 'Source Sans 3', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  --font-accent: 'DM Sans', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
  -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-weight: 400;
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  background: var(--cloud);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
}

img,
svg {
  max-width: 100%;
  display: block;
}

a {
  color: inherit;
  text-decoration: none;
}

p {
  margin: 0 0 1em;
}

h1, h2, h3, h4, h5, h6 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

button {
  font-family: inherit;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* ============= Layout primitives ============= */
.container {
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

.container--narrow {
  max-width: var(--container-narrow);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}

/* ============= Eyebrow / Accent text ============= */
.eyebrow {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  display: inline-block;
}

.eyebrow--sage {
  color: var(--sage);
}

/* ============= Buttons ============= */
.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 15px;
  letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  border-radius: 10px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  background: transparent;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  text-decoration: none;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.btn--primary {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}
.btn--primary:hover {
  background: var(--sage-deep);
  border-color: var(--sage-deep);
}

.btn--secondary {
  color: var(--slate);
  border-color: var(--slate);
}
.btn--secondary:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.btn--ghost-light {
  color: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--white);
}
.btn--ghost-light:hover {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
}

.btn--outline-stone {
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--slate);
  border-color: var(--stone);
}
.btn--outline-stone:hover {
  border-color: var(--sage);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.btn--small {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.text-link {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--sage);
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  padding-bottom: 2px;
  transition: color 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}
.text-link:hover {
  color: var(--slate);
  border-bottom-color: var(--slate);
}

.text-link__arrow {
  display: inline-block;
  transition: transform 200ms ease;
}
.text-link:hover .text-link__arrow {
  transform: translateX(3px);
}

/* ============= Site Navigation ============= */
.site-nav {
  background: var(--slate);
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 100;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
}

.site-nav__inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 18px 24px;
  max-width: var(--container);
  margin: 0 auto;
  gap: 24px;
}

.site-nav__brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 18px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.brand-mark {
  width: 28px;
  height: 28px;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.site-nav__links {
  display: flex;
  gap: 4px;
  align-items: center;
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

.site-nav__link {
  color: #B8C3D0;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 14px;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  transition: color 200ms ease, background 200ms ease;
}
.site-nav__link:hover {
  color: var(--white);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
}
.site-nav__link.is-active {
  color: var(--sage);
}

.site-nav__cta {
  background: var(--sage);
  color: var(--white);
  padding: 10px 18px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: background 200ms ease;
}
.site-nav__cta:hover {
  background: var(--sage-deep);
}

.nav-toggle {
  display: none;
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 8px;
  color: var(--white);
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .site-nav__links {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    top: 100%;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    background: var(--slate);
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 16px;
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }
  .site-nav__links.is-open {
    display: flex;
  }
  .site-nav__link {
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }
  .site-nav__cta {
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .nav-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .site-nav {
    position: relative;
  }
}

/* ============= Footer ============= */
.site-footer {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: #B8C3D0;
  padding: 64px 0 32px;
}

.site-footer__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  padding-bottom: 40px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
}

.site-footer__col h4 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.site-footer__col ul {
  list-style: none;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

.site-footer__col li {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.site-footer__col a {
  color: #B8C3D0;
  font-size: 14px;
  transition: color 200ms ease;
}
.site-footer__col a:hover {
  color: var(--sage);
}

.site-footer__brand {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  color: var(--white);
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 14px;
}

.site-footer__tagline {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: #B8C3D0;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 320px;
}

.site-footer__bottom {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding-top: 24px;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: #8895A8;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 12px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .site-footer__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .site-footer__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }
}

/* ============= Section base ============= */
section {
  padding: 100px 0;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  section { padding: 72px 0; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  section { padding: 56px 0; }
}

.section--mist { background: var(--mist); }
.section--white { background: var(--white); }
.section--cloud { background: var(--cloud); }
.section--slate { background: var(--slate); color: var(--white); }
.section--dew { background: var(--dew); }
.section--gradient {
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--dew) 0%, var(--cloud) 100%);
}

.section-head {
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.section-head--center {
  text-align: center;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.section-head h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.section-head p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 580px;
}

.section-head--center p {
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
}

/* ============= HOME — Hero ============= */
.hero {
  padding: 96px 0 100px;
  background: var(--cloud);
}

.hero__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}

.hero__eyebrow {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  padding: 6px 14px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.hero__eyebrow::before {
  content: "";
  width: 6px;
  height: 6px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 50%;
}

.hero__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: clamp(36px, 5.6vw, 60px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  line-height: 1.08;
  margin: 22px 0 24px;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.hero__sub {
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--stone);
  max-width: 520px;
  margin: 0 0 32px;
}

.hero__ctas {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 14px;
}

.hero__art {
  border-radius: var(--radius-2xl);
  background: var(--white);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  padding: 24px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.hero__art svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
  display: block;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .hero__grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 40px;
  }
  .hero__art { max-height: 400px; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .hero__art {
    max-height: 220px;
    padding: 12px;
  }
}

/* ============= Stats ============= */
.stats-head {
  text-align: center;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}

.stats-head h2 {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 36px);
  font-weight: 700;
  max-width: 560px;
  margin: 12px auto 0;
}

.stats-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.stat-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  padding: 32px 24px;
  text-align: center;
  min-height: 140px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.stat-card--accent {
  background: var(--dew);
}

.stat-card__value {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 40px;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  color: var(--sage);
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.stat-card--solid .stat-card__value {
  color: var(--slate);
  font-size: 44px;
}

.stat-card__label {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin: 12px 0 0;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .stats-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Feature grid (asymmetric bento) ============= */
.feature-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.35fr 1fr;
  grid-template-rows: auto auto;
  gap: 16px;
}

.feature-tile {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.feature-tile__icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.feature-tile h3 {
  font-size: 19px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 8px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.feature-tile p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0;
}

.feature-tile--dew { background: var(--dew); }
.feature-tile--mist { background: var(--mist); }

.feature-tile--dark {
  background: var(--slate);
  color: var(--white);
  grid-row: 1 / span 2;
  grid-column: 2;
  min-height: 376px;
}

.feature-tile--dark h3 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: 22px;
}

.feature-tile--dark p {
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
  font-size: 15px;
}

.feature-tile--dark .feature-tile__icon { color: var(--sage); }

.feature-tile--dark::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 280px;
  height: 280px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.12;
  right: -90px;
  bottom: -90px;
}

.feature-tile--dark::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  width: 180px;
  height: 180px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid rgba(74, 174, 140, 0.18);
  right: 30px;
  top: 30px;
}

.feature-grid__cta {
  margin-top: 28px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .feature-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto;
  }
  .feature-tile--dark {
    grid-row: auto;
    grid-column: auto;
    min-height: 0;
  }
}
@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Testimonials ============= */
.testimonial-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.testimonial-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 36px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  position: relative;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.testimonial-card--dew {
  background: var(--dew);
}

.testimonial-card__coral-dot {
  position: absolute;
  top: 18px;
  right: 18px;
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: var(--coral);
}

.testimonial-card__quote-mark {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 800;
  font-size: 64px;
  color: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.30;
  line-height: 0.7;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.testimonial-card__title {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  line-height: 1.35;
}

.testimonial-card__body {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.testimonial-card__attr {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: auto;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .testimonial-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .testimonial-card:nth-child(3) { grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 60%; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .testimonial-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .testimonial-card:nth-child(3) { max-width: none; }
}

/* ============= Final CTA Slate ============= */
.final-cta {
  position: relative;
  text-align: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.final-cta__inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 1;
}

.final-cta .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }

.final-cta h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 48px);
  color: var(--white);
  max-width: 640px;
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
  line-height: 1.2;
}

.final-cta p {
  font-size: 18px;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
  max-width: 480px;
  margin: 0 auto 36px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.final-cta__ctas {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.final-cta__pattern {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  opacity: 0.5;
  pointer-events: none;
}

@media (max-width: 540px) {
  .final-cta__ctas {
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: stretch;
    max-width: 320px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
}

/* ============= Page header (compact) ============= */
.page-header {
  padding: 72px 0 56px;
  text-align: center;
}

.page-header h1 {
  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  line-height: 1.1;
}

.page-header p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 19px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 20px auto 0;
}

.page-header__rule {
  width: 48px;
  height: 1px;
  background: var(--mist);
  margin: 0 auto 20px;
  display: block;
}

.page-header--mist {
  background: var(--mist);
}

.page-header--with-art {
  position: relative;
  text-align: left;
}

.page-header--with-art .container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  align-items: center;
}

.page-header--with-art h1 {
  margin: 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.page-header--with-art p {
  margin: 16px 0 0;
  text-align: left;
}

.page-header__cluster {
  display: flex;
  gap: 14px;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  align-items: center;
  height: 200px;
  position: relative;
}

.page-header__cluster span {
  display: block;
  width: 80px;
  height: 48px;
  border-radius: 12px;
}

.page-header__cluster span:nth-child(1) {
  background: var(--dew);
  transform: rotate(-4deg);
}
.page-header__cluster span:nth-child(2) {
  background: var(--white);
  transform: rotate(3deg);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
}
.page-header__cluster span:nth-child(3) {
  background: var(--dew);
  transform: rotate(5deg);
  width: 60px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .page-header--with-art .container {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .page-header--with-art h1,
  .page-header--with-art p { text-align: center; }
  .page-header__cluster { display: none; }
}

/* ============= Services: Item grid ============= */
.service-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.service-card {
  background: var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.service-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}

.service-card__icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.service-card h3 {
  font-size: 20px;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 0 0 10px;
}

.service-card p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.service-card__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
  margin-top: auto;
}

.pill {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 5px 11px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
}

.pill--mist {
  background: var(--mist);
  color: var(--stone);
}

.pill--coral {
  background: var(--coral-tint);
  color: var(--coral);
}

.service-cta-row {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 40px;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .service-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Comparison ============= */
.compare-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.compare-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.compare-card--dew { background: var(--dew); }

.compare-card h3 {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.compare-card p {
  font-size: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 0 20px;
}

.compare-card__meta {
  margin-top: auto;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  padding-top: 20px;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
}

.compare-card__meta dt {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-bottom: 4px;
}

.compare-card__meta dd {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0;
  line-height: 1.4;
}

@media (max-width: 720px) {
  .compare-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= FAQ ============= */
.faq-list {
  max-width: 760px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
}

.faq-item {
  background: var(--cloud);
  border-radius: 14px;
  padding: 0;
  border: 1.5px solid transparent;
  transition: background 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
}

.faq-item.is-open {
  background: var(--white);
  border-color: var(--sage);
}

.faq-item__btn {
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  background: transparent;
  border: none;
  padding: 20px 24px;
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--slate);
  text-align: left;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.faq-item__chevron {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--stone);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: transform 200ms ease;
  margin-left: 16px;
}

.faq-item.is-open .faq-item__chevron {
  transform: rotate(180deg);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.faq-item__panel {
  display: none;
  padding: 0 24px 20px;
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}

.faq-item.is-open .faq-item__panel {
  display: block;
}

.faq-section__cta {
  margin-top: 32px;
}

/* ============= Services CTA section ============= */
.services-final {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
  gap: 40px;
  align-items: center;
}

.services-final__copy h2 {
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  max-width: 480px;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.services-final__copy p {
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 420px;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
}

.services-final__ctas {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.services-final__art {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: flex-end;
}

.services-final__art svg {
  max-width: 340px;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .services-final { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .services-final__art { display: none; }
}

/* ============= Practitioners grid ============= */
.practitioner-section .section-head {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: flex-start;
}

.practitioner-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.practitioner-grid__item--wide {
  grid-column: span 2;
}

.practitioner-grid__item--center {
  grid-column: 2;
}

.practitioner-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  height: 100%;
}

.practitioner-card__head {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.practitioner-card__avatar {
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  background: var(--dew);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.practitioner-card__avatar svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.practitioner-card__name {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 18px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 0 0 6px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.practitioner-card__specialty {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--sage);
  margin: 0;
}

.practitioner-card p {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin: 0 0 16px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.practitioner-card__divider {
  border: none;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mist);
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.practitioner-card__meta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 8px;
}

.tag {
  background: var(--mist);
  color: var(--stone);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 10px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  padding: 6px 10px;
  border-radius: 6px;
}

.tag--accept {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
}

.tag--limited {
  background: var(--coral-tint);
  color: var(--coral);
}

.practitioner-cta {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 48px;
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .practitioner-grid__item--wide { grid-column: span 2; }
  .practitioner-grid__item--center { grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }
}

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .practitioner-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .practitioner-grid__item--wide,
  .practitioner-grid__item--center { grid-column: auto; max-width: none; }
}

/* ============= Story block (philosophy) ============= */
.story-split {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}

.story-split .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }

.story-split h2 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 38px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  margin: 0 0 24px;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.story-split p {
  color: #B8C3D0;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin: 0;
  max-width: 580px;
}

.story-art {
  position: relative;
  height: 340px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.story-art__bg {
  position: absolute;
  inset: 0;
  background: rgba(232, 238, 244, 0.10);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 40px;
}

.story-art__quote {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-style: italic;
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: 20px;
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.4;
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
}

.story-art__tile-tr {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  right: 0;
  width: 100px;
  height: 100px;
  background: var(--dew);
  opacity: 0.20;
  border-radius: 16px;
}

.story-art__tile-bl {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  background: var(--sage);
  opacity: 0.20;
  border-radius: 16px;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .story-split { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .story-art { display: none; }
}

/* ============= Stats with chart ============= */
.stats-with-chart {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.stats-with-chart__cluster {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.stat-card--solid {
  background: var(--white);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 32px;
}

.chart-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 28px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.06);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.chart-card svg {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 220px;
  height: auto;
}

.chart-card__title {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 16px;
  text-align: center;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .stats-with-chart { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .chart-card { max-width: 320px; margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; }
}
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .stats-with-chart__cluster { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
  .stat-card--solid { padding: 22px; }
  .stat-card--solid .stat-card__value { font-size: 32px; }
}

/* ============= CTA reassure note ============= */
.cta-reassure {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 28px;
  text-align: center;
}

.cta-reassure span + span::before {
  content: "·";
  margin: 0 8px;
  color: var(--stone);
}

/* ============= Resources ============= */
.resources-page-header h1 .accent {
  position: relative;
  display: inline-block;
}
.resources-page-header h1 .accent::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 4px;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: 2px;
  opacity: 0.85;
}

/* Asymmetric article bento */
.article-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  grid-template-rows: auto auto;
  gap: 16px;
}

.article-card {
  background: var(--white);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 24px;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.07);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  transition: box-shadow 200ms ease, transform 200ms ease, border-color 200ms ease;
  border-left: 3px solid transparent;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.article-card:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.12);
  background: var(--mist);
  border-left-color: var(--sage);
}

.article-card--hero {
  grid-column: span 2;
  grid-row: span 1;
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: none;
  background: var(--white);
}

.article-card--hero::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  height: 4px;
  background: var(--sage);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl) var(--radius-xl) 0 0;
}

.article-card--side {
  grid-column: 3;
  grid-row: span 1;
}

.article-card__category {
  background: var(--dew);
  color: var(--sage);
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 11px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.10em;
  padding: 5px 11px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  display: inline-flex;
  align-self: flex-start;
}

.article-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 17px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 14px 0 8px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.article-card--hero h3 {
  font-size: 26px;
  line-height: 1.25;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
}

.article-card p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin: 0 0 18px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.article-card--hero p {
  font-size: 16px;
}

.article-card__time {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: auto;
}

.article-card__time svg {
  width: 13px;
  height: 13px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

@media (max-width: 1024px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: span 2; }
  .article-card--side { grid-column: auto; }
}
@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .article-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .article-card--hero { grid-column: auto; }
}

/* Resource library tiles */
.resource-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
  gap: 16px;
}

.resource-tile {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: 28px;
  padding: 32px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 240px;
  transition: background 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
}

.resource-tile:hover {
  background: var(--mist);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.10);
}

.resource-tile--coral {
  background: var(--white);
  border-left: 3px solid var(--coral);
}

.resource-tile--coral:hover {
  background: var(--coral-bg);
}

.resource-tile__icon {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.resource-tile--coral .resource-tile__icon { color: var(--coral); }

.resource-tile h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 20px;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 16px 0 8px;
  line-height: 1.3;
}

.resource-tile p {
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 14px;
  flex-grow: 1;
}

.resource-tile__link {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 13px;
  color: var(--sage);
  border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;
  display: inline-flex;
  gap: 4px;
  align-items: center;
  align-self: flex-start;
}

.resource-tile__link:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--sage); }

@media (max-width: 640px) {
  .resource-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* Story block (resources) */
.story-block {
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.story-block__body {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
  padding-left: 20px;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--stone);
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.story-block h2 {
  font-size: clamp(26px, 3.5vw, 40px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
}

/* Resources final CTA (slate split) */
.cta-split-dark {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
  gap: 56px;
  align-items: center;
}

.cta-split-dark .eyebrow { color: var(--sage); }

.cta-split-dark h2 {
  color: var(--white);
  font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  line-height: 1.15;
  margin: 0 0 16px;
}

.cta-split-dark p {
  color: #A8B4C2;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  max-width: 520px;
}

.cta-split-dark__ctas {
  display: flex;
  gap: 16px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.cta-split-dark__art {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
}

.cta-split-dark__art svg {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 320px;
  height: auto;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .cta-split-dark {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-split-dark__ctas { justify-content: center; }
  .cta-split-dark p { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }
  .cta-split-dark__art { order: -1; }
  .cta-split-dark__art svg { max-width: 220px; }
}

/* ============= Contact form ============= */
.contact-block {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: start;
}

.contact-form {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}

.contact-form__head .eyebrow { color: var(--stone); }

.contact-form h2 {
  font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 30px);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 8px 0 12px;
}

.contact-form > p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 28px;
  max-width: 540px;
}

.contact-form__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 16px;
}

.contact-form .field {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 6px;
}

.contact-form .field--full {
  grid-column: 1 / -1;
}

.contact-form label {
  font-family: var(--font-accent);
  font-weight: 500;
  font-size: 12px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--stone);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
}

.contact-form label .req {
  color: var(--sage);
  font-size: 8px;
}

.contact-form input,
.contact-form select,
.contact-form textarea {
  width: 100%;
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  font-size: 15px;
  color: var(--slate);
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  padding: 12px 14px;
  background: var(--white);
  transition: border-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.contact-form input::placeholder,
.contact-form textarea::placeholder {
  color: rgba(107, 122, 143, 0.6);
}

.contact-form input:focus,
.contact-form select:focus,
.contact-form textarea:focus {
  outline: none;
  border-color: var(--sage);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(74, 174, 140, 0.15);
}

.contact-form textarea {
  min-height: 120px;
  resize: vertical;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.contact-form .btn {
  margin-top: 24px;
  width: 100%;
  height: 52px;
  padding: 0;
  font-size: 15px;
}

.contact-aside {
  position: sticky;
  top: 100px;
}

.reassure-card {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 32px;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--sage);
}

.reassure-card__intro {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: flex-start;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
}

.reassure-card__intro svg {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

.reassure-list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0 0 4px;
}

.reassure-list li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.5;
  padding: 5px 0;
}

.reassure-list svg {
  width: 14px;
  height: 14px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.contact-aside__phone {
  margin-top: 24px;
  font-style: italic;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.6;
}
.contact-aside__phone strong {
  color: var(--sage);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-style: normal;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .contact-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
  .contact-aside { position: static; }
  .contact-form__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Map block ============= */
.map-block {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: stretch;
}

.map-tile {
  border-radius: 20px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid var(--mist);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(26, 35, 50, 0.08);
  background: var(--mist);
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  display: flex;
}

.map-tile svg {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  display: block;
}

.map-info h2 {
  font-size: clamp(22px, 3vw, 28px);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin: 8px 0 12px;
}

.map-info > p {
  color: var(--stone);
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0 0 12px;
}

.map-info__address {
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--slate);
  margin: 20px 0;
}

.map-info__address strong {
  font-weight: 600;
}

.map-info__list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 24px;
}

.map-info__list-item {
  display: flex;
  gap: 10px;
  align-items: center;
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
}

.map-info__list-item svg {
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  color: var(--sage);
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

@media (max-width: 880px) {
  .map-block { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
}

/* ============= Contact info grid (4 cards) ============= */
.contact-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 20px;
}

.contact-tile {
  background: var(--dew);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 28px 24px;
  transition: background 200ms ease;
}

.contact-tile:hover {
  background: #C5E8DD;
}

.contact-tile__icon {
  width: 32px;
  height: 32px;
  color: var(--sage);
}

.contact-tile h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-heading);
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 16px;
  margin: 12px 0 8px;
  letter-spacing: -0.01em;
}

.contact-tile p {
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--stone);
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin: 0;
}

.contact-tile p strong {
  color: var(--sage);
  font-weight: 600;
}

